35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The weather cost us six weeks. And comfort projects always slip.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,We paid for off-site rooms for two terms. And specialist rooms are empty.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The grounds posts are empty, but the technicians have spare hours.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Projects are rated lowest when only one wing uses them.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Mechanical costs rose by a fifth. And we have no reserve for old kit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that mechanical cost rise is worrying.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, so we should avoid single-wing projects?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, weather is a risk for outdoor work.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, yes, shared space seems better.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
