45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Outdoor work is risky. Indoor work might be safer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,General rooms are in high demand. Specialist ones are not.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,We could use the spare technician hours for maintenance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,A shared space would likely get better ratings.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need to avoid expensive mechanical upgrades if possible.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning towards something indoor and shared.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I agree. The data supports general use.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I am concerned about the maintenance burden.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I think a study commons would work well.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I need to see the candidates to be sure.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
